# Phyrexian Unlife (CR 702.90b, 104.3b): damage that takes a positive life total to 0 or less is dealt as ordinary damage,
# since Bot1 has more than 0 life as it is dealt (the 2011-06-01 ruling): Bot1, at 1 life, is Bolted to -2 and has no poison
# counters, and doesn't lose for having 0 or less life. The next damage, a second Bolt, is dealt as though its source had
# infect: three poison counters, and Bot1's life stays at -2.

[Life]
Bot1: 1

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Phyrexian Unlife
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Unlife.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = -2
? Bot1.Poison = 0
? Result = InProgress
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.End]

[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot1.Life = -2
Bot1.Poison = 3
Bot1.Status = (absent)
